      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a quarterly performance review for one of my Senior Account Executives? They've been doing great with client retention and keeping our big accounts happy, but I need to address the fact that they've been consistently late for our internal morning stand-up meetings. I want it to be professional and constructive, not too harsh but firm about the punctuality issue. Thanks.",
