      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but it feels a little generic. could you maybe expand a bit more on the punctuality part? i want to make sure they understand that it's not just about being 'late' but about the impact it has on the rest of the team during those meetings. can you add a sentence or two about the ripple effect of their absence at the start of the day?",
